invalid type: string "8. Waste Reduction\n8.1 Sustainability\nImplement practices to reduce waste: inventory control, portion control, and staff training. Target: 10%\nreduction annually per branch.\n8.2 Environmental Compliance\nAdhere to local environmental regulations. Keep disposal manifests for 3 years. Conduct annual waste\naudits.\n9. Manager Responsibilities\nl packaging.\nÿG~ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ